# Machine-local overrides
.pi/settings.local.json

# Local plans, audit reports, handoff notes, and review diagrams
/docs/plans/
/docs/audits/
/docs/HANDOFF-*.md
/docs/*-AUDIT*.md

# Legacy large-mode launcher (superseded by /large on)
/bin/pi-large

# Stray root lockfile (no root package.json)
/package-lock.json
